WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.739
Go to Workflows and click Create workflow

00:00:03.739 --> 00:00:05.862
Name it

00:00:05.862 --> 00:00:08.102
Click + on Start and add an Agent block

00:00:08.102 --> 00:00:16.367
Pick the agent, its numbers, and fill its variables

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:25.297
Add a Conditional: did the borrower promise to pay?

00:00:25.297 --> 00:00:32.580
On Match, add an Action that calls your CRM

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:37.361
On No match, add an Await block: wait 1 day

00:00:37.361 --> 00:00:47.452
Then an Agent block in Chat mode: a WhatsApp nudge

00:00:47.452 --> 00:00:49.084
Call, branch, act, wait and message in one flow

00:00:49.084 --> 00:00:50.903
Click Save

00:00:50.903 --> 00:00:54.035
Click Publish, then confirm

00:00:54.035 --> 00:00:57.808
Click Test and enter who to call

00:00:57.808 --> 00:01:03.070
Click Start run and watch each block finish

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:05.601
Completed: the run took the Match path
